    <string name="settings_privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_policy_text">ShelfDrive connects to the selected audiobook server you enter in Settings. Credentials are stored encrypted on this device. Catalog data, cover art, playback state, and listening progress are synchronized with your server.\n\nShelfDrive stores the server URL, username, encrypted password or session token, local catalog metadata, cover art, playback state, listening progress, cache data, and app settings on this device.\n\nShelfDrive connects to the selected audiobook server URL configured by you to sign in, load the catalog, stream audio, load artwork, and synchronize listening progress. The app does not include ads, analytics SDKs, tracking SDKs, or developer-operated content services.\n\nShelfDrive does not sell user data and does not share user data with advertising or analytics providers.\n\nYou can remove account/session data by logging out. You can remove cached catalog, artwork, and locally cached progress with Clear cache or by clearing app data in Android settings.</string>
    <string name="settings_legal_notice_title">Legal notice</string>
    <string name="settings_legal_notice_text">ShelfDrive is an independent project and is not affiliated with Audiobookshelf.\n\nShelfDrive does not provide audiobooks, catalogs, hosting, network access, VPN, reverse proxy, or server management. You are responsible for your selected audiobook server, your login credentials, your network setup, and the content available through your server.\n\nConfigure the app only when it is safe and legal to do so. Follow your vehicle system rules and local traffic laws.\n\nShelfDrive is provided without a guarantee of uninterrupted availability, compatibility with every Android Automotive OS vehicle, or protection against server, network, cache, or playback failures.</string>
    <string name="settings_diagnostics_upload_disclosure_title">Send diagnostics?</string>
    <string name="settings_diagnostics_upload_disclosure_text">ShelfDrive will create a ZIP package with app diagnostics and upload it to the diagnostics upload URL shown in Settings. The package may include app logs, app version, device/runtime details, connection and sync status, cache status, restore status, and error messages. It does not include your saved password.\n\nSend diagnostics only if you want to share this information with the recipient of the shown upload URL.</string>
